#. macro: <ui-edge-color 509> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 509 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>As ablest of Ixal, Yazel Ahuatan has a reputation to maintain.<br>※The crafting portion of this quest is recommended for Disciples of the Hand level 1 and above, and the battle portion for Disciples of War or Magic level 41 and above."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ※本クエストには「<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> レベルアジャスト」が、<br>　設定されています。<br><br>職工のヤゼル・アファタンから「<sheet Item "　8093" 0>」の製作を依頼された。まずはひそひそ木立に向かい、<sheet BNpcName 2985 0>を退けて、奪われた「<sheet EObj 2004456 0>」から「<sheet EventItem 2001379 0>」を入手しよう。
#. de: <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509></ui-edge-color></ui-color> Die Schwierigkeit des Auftrags wird an die aktuelle Stufe angepasst.<br><br>Yazel Ahuatan hat dich mit der Herstellung von <noun-de Item 5 "　8093" 2 4 1> betraut, doch zunächst musst du das dafür benötigte Material aus einem der geraubten <noun-de EObj 5 2004456 2 1 1> in Flüsterhain besorgen.
#. fr: * <i>Cette quête est <ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> synchronisée</ui-edge-color></ui-color> avec votre niveau.</i><br><br>Yazel Ahuatan vous a confié la tâche de fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8093" 2 1>. Pour commencer, vous allez devoir vous rendre à la futaie des Murmures pour retrouver <noun-fr EObj 2 2004456 2 1> qui ont été volé<if "<sheet EObj 2004456 6>">e</if>s par <noun-fr BNpcName 1 2985 2 1>.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "The recent loss of starboard hull component materials has placed Yazel Ahuatan in a precarious position. So that none may have cause to doubt his ableness, recover the materials his courier abandoned when attacked by Ixal in Treespeak.<br><br>※Please note that the difficulty of this quest has been synced to your current level."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <sheet EventItem 2001379 0>を奪い返した。ツリースピーク厩舎の「ネルモン」に「<sheet EventItem 2001379 0>」を渡し、製作施設の使用許可をもらおう。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de EventItem 2 2001379 1 4 1> zurückerobert. Bring es zu Nellemond an der Flüsterhain-Stallung und bitte ihn, seine Arbeitsstätte benutzen zu dürfen.
#. fr: Vous avez mis la main sur le contenu d'<noun-fr EObj 1 2004456 1 1>. Rendez-vous maintenant aux écuries des Murmures et demandez à Nellemond l'au<shy>to<shy>ri<shy>sa<shy>tion d'utiliser les ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions d'artisanat.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "After a brief skirmish, the materials are yours. However, returning the materials will not suffice to redeem Yazel Ahuatan. Visit the crafting facility at Treespeak Stables, and present the component materials to Nellemond, so that you may use the facilities to construct the requisite components."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作施設の準備が整った。「<sheet Item "　8054" 0>」をもとに「<sheet Item "　8093" 0>」を2つ製作し、エカトル実験場の「職工のヤゼル・アファタン」に納品しよう。<br><br>※バフステータス「製作施設：精密工作」が終了した場合や、「<sheet Item "　8054" 0>」を失った場合は、再びネルモンに話しかけましょう。バフステータスと材料が付与され、再挑戦が可能になります。
#. de: Nellemond hat dir erlaubt, seine Arbeitsstätte zu benutzen. Verarbeite <noun-de Item 2 "　8054" 2 4 1> zu zwei <noun-de Item 5 "　8093" 2 3 1> und bringe sie zu Yazel Ahuatan in Ehcatl.<br><br>※ Sollte der Status <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Arbeitsstätte: Herstellung</ui-edge-color></ui-color> enden oder <noun-de Item 2 "　8054" 2 1 1> verloren gehen, kannst du Nellemond erneut um Hilfe bitten. Er wird dir dann die Materialien und die Arbeitsstätte für einen neuen Versuch zur Verfügung stellen.
#. fr: Tout est prêt pour que vous commenciez à travailler. En vous servant des matériaux, fabriquez deux <noun-fr Item 12 "　8093" 2 1> et remettez-les à Yazel Ahuatan, au centre d'essais d'Ehcatl.<br>* <i>Adressez-vous de nouveau à Nellemond si vous n'avez plus de matériaux ou si vous avez perdu l'effet Installation<nbsp>: finition.</i>
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "You have handed over the component materials to Nellemond, and gained access to the crafting facility. Synthesize two starboard hull components, and deliver them to Yazel Ahuatan at Ehcatl.<br><br>※In the event that the status <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Facility Access: Finishing</ui-edge-color></ui-color> wears off or the synthesis ends in failure, you may try again by speaking with Nellemond."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 職工のヤゼル・アファタンに<sheet Item "　8093" 0>を納品した。イクサル軍伐採所との仁義なき抗争は、解決のきざしすら見えない。彼らの嫌がらせに屈することなく、エカトル空力団の仲間を応援していこう。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 "　8093" 2 4 1> bei Yazel Ahuatan abgeliefert. Damit hast du den Ixal aus Ixal-Kahlhieb eine Lehre erteilt, nicht auf ihren Artgenossen aus Ehcatl herumzuhacken. Dank dir können die Wolkengleiter weiter ihren Traum vom Fliegen verfolgen.
#. fr: Vous avez apporté à Yazel Ahuatan <noun-fr Item 2 "　8093" 2 1> dont il avait besoin. D'après lui, ses congénères du site de déboisement ixal ne sont pas près d'arrêter leurs agissements néfastes. Aidez les Planeurs d'Ehcatl à mener à bien leur projet malgré tout.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "The squa-hawk which echoes throughout Ehcatl is one of ultimate relief, as Yazel Ahuatan's comrades no longer have cause to doubt his competence. Maintaining an image as an able Ixal can be difficult at times, but the adulation of Ixali maidens more than justifies the effort─or so Yazel Ahuatan would doubtless say, if the question were put to him."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ひそひそ木立の<sheet EObj 2004456 0>から<sheet EventItem 2001379 0>を<br>妨害を退け入手
#. de: In Flüsterhain <noun-de EventItem 2 2001379 1 4 1> aus einem der <noun-de EObj 5 2004456 2 1 1> bergen
#. fr: Obtenir <noun-fr EventItem 1 2001379 1 1> dans <noun-fr EObj 1 2004456 1 1> à la futaie des Murmures
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Obtain starboard hull component materials from the Ehcatl Nine storage pots in Treespeak."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ツリースピーク厩舎のネルモンに<sheet EventItem 2001379 0>を渡す
#. de: Nellemond an der Flüsterhain-Stallung <noun-de EventItem 2 2001379 1 4 1> geben
#. fr: Remettre <noun-fr EventItem 2 2001379 1 1> à Nellemond
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_TODO_01:1"
msgid "Present the starboard hull component materials to Nellemond at Treespeak Stables."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($n1 < $n2)>製作手帳 友好部族クエストLv1：<sheet Item "　8093" 0>を製作<else>職工のヤゼル・アファタンに<sheet Item "　8093" 0>を納品</if>
#. de: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Handwerker-Notizbuch (Freundesvölker) St.1: <noun-de Item 5 "　8093" 2 4 1> herstellen<else>Yazel Ahuatan <noun-de Item 2 "　8093" 2 4 1> bringen</if>
#. fr: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Fabriquer <noun-fr Item 1 "　8093" 2 1><else>Apporter <noun-fr Item 2 "　8093" 2 1> à Yazel Ahuatan</if>
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Synthesize starboard hull components<else>Deliver the starboard hull components to Yazel Ahuatan the Able</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_TODO_02:1"
msgid "<if ($n1 < $n2)>Synthesize starboard hull components<else>Deliver the starboard hull components to Yazel Ahuatan the Able</if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 困った、このままじゃ「<sheet Item "　8093" 0>」が2つ足らんわッァ！<br>材料を運んでた仲間が伐採所の連中に襲われて、<br>荷を落としちまったんだッァ！
#. de: Khaa, khaa, uns fehlen noch zwei <noun-de Item 5 "　8093" 2 1 1>! Ixal aus Kahlhieb haben Material dafür auf dem Weg hierher geraubt.
#. fr: Des compagnons de celui-ci sont tombés dans une embuscade alors qu'ils transportaient les matériaux qui devaient servir à créer deux <noun-fr Item 12 "　8093" 2 1><nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_000:1"
msgid "Squaaawk! Able though I am, cursed with terrible fortune, I am too! Lost to Garuda-worshipping buzzards, materials for constructing urgently required starboard hull components are!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 頼むッゥ！　材料を取り戻してッェ、<br>右舷船体に使う軽金属板を製作してくれッェ！<br>頑丈な船体を作るには、どうしても必要なんじゃッァ！
#. de: <if $gn4>Federlose<else>Federloser</if>, hilfst du uns, khaa! Besorgst du Material und machst Beschläge für Rumpf, khaa, damit er wird ganz robust!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Celle-là<else>Celui-là</if> ne pourrait pas essayer de les retrouver puis se charger de fabriquer des plaques d'acier léger qui serviront à solidifier la nacelle de l'aéronef de ceux-ci<nbsp>?
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_010:1"
msgid "Precious materials for constructing the hull, lost to our enemies in Treespeak! Squa-hawk!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 頼むッゥ！　材料を取り戻してッェ、<br>右舷船体の仕上げに使う上塗り剤を製作してくれッェ！<br>長持ちする船体を作るには、どうしても必要なんじゃッァ！
#. de: <if $gn4>Federlose<else>Federloser</if>, hilfst du uns, khaa! Besorgst du Material und machst Schutzlack für Rumpf, khaa, damit er wird ganz dicht!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Celle-là<else>Celui-là</if> ne pourrait pas essayer de les retrouver puis se charger de préparer des enduits qui serviront à améliorer la résistance de la nacelle de l'aéronef de ceux-ci<nbsp>?
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_020:1"
msgid "Precious materials for preparing an essential finish for the hull, lost to our enemies in Treespeak! Squa-hawk!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 頼むッゥ！　材料を取り戻してッェ、<br>右舷船体に使う、革張りの合板を製作してくれッェ！<br>軽量な船体を作るには、どうしても必要なんじゃッァ！
#. de: <if $gn4>Federlose<else>Federloser</if>, hilfst du uns, khaa! Besorgst du Material und machst Bauteil für Rumpf, khaa, damit er wird ganz leicht und stabil!
#. fr: <if $gn4>Celle-là<else>Celui-là</if> ne pourrait pas essayer de les retrouver puis se charger de fabriquer du contreplaqué recouvert de cuir qui permettra d'alléger la nacelle de l'aéronef de ceux-ci<nbsp>?
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_030:1"
msgid "Precious materials for preparing leather-backed plywood for the hull, lost to our enemies in Treespeak! Squa-hawk!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 材料が入った「<sheet EObj 2004456 0>」はッァ、<br>仲間が襲われた「ひそひそ木立」に落ちているはずだッァ！<br>襲った連中に警戒しながら、探してくれッェ！
#. de: Material steckte in Behältern, die in Flüsterhain geraubt wurden! Suchst du danach, kha! Aber passt du auf vor Dieben!
#. fr: Les matériaux sont à l'intérieur de <noun-fr EObj 12 2004456 2 1>, à la futaie des Murmures, là où ses compagnons ont été assaillis. Que <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> se méfie, car les coupables ne sont sûrement pas bien loin<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_040:1"
msgid "Retrieve the materials myself, I would, but able <i>lover</i>, Yazel is─not able fighter. Featherless <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> and fighter both, you are, and more than capable of recovering materials."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 材料を取り戻したら、その足で製作も頼むぜッェ！<br>「ネルモン」って男が仕切る、<br>ツリースピーク厩舎の施設を使えッェ！
#. de: Kahhh, und wenn du Material hast, bringst du zu Nellemond in Flüsterhain-Stallung und benutzt seine Arbeitsstätte, khaaa!
#. fr: Une fois les matériaux retrouvés, <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> devra se rendre aux écuries des Murmures et parler à Nellemond avant de faire usage des techniques d'artisanat dont <if $gn4>elle<else>il</if> a le secret.
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_041:1"
msgid "From storage pots, retrieve the materials, then for crafting, to Treespeak Stables you must go. Open to all featherless, the facilities there are. Squahaha! Need for special favors, there is not."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item "　8093" 0>」を2つッゥ……<br><if $gn4>ネエチャン<else>アンチャン</if>、お願いじゃッァ！<br>頼めるのは、ケンカが強くて技も冴えたアンタだけじゃッァ！
#. de: Khaaa, khaaa, zwei <noun-de Item 5 "　8093" 2 4 1> brauchen wir! Schnell, schnell, <if $gn4>Federlose<else>Federloser</if>!
#. fr: Celui-ci fait appel à <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> car personne n'est aussi versé dans le combat et l'artisanat à la fois<nbsp>! Que <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> retrouve les deux <noun-fr Item 12 "　8093" 2 1>, celui-ci l'en prie<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_050:1"
msgid "Materials enough for two components, you must recover! Without components, Yazel will fall out of favor. Able to suffer much, Yazel is, except that!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 敵の気配を感じた！！
#. de: Du spürst eine feindliche Präsenz!
#. fr: Vous ressentez une présence hostile<nbsp>!
#. kind: other
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_POP_MESSAGE:1"
msgid "With a cacophony of squawking, the enemy appears!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: このハネナシがッァ！
#. de: Stirb, <if $gn4>Federlose<else>Federloser</if>!
#. fr: Maudit chacal des cités<nbsp>!
#. speaker: BALOON
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_BALOON_000_080:1"
msgid "Unfeathered! Fly!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ギャハーッァ、渡すかッァ！
#. de: Finger weg!
#. fr: Celui-ci va couper la langue de <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if><nbsp>!
#. speaker: BALOON
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_BALOON_000_081:1"
msgid "Squaaawk! Friend of Ehcatl, you die!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらの製作施設は、冒険者の方にも広く開放しております。<br>利用される前に、持ち込んだ材料を私にお預けください。
#. de: Meine Arbeitsstätte stelle ich gerne allen Abenteurern zur Verfügung. Zeig mir bitte das Material, das du verarbeiten möchtest, bevor du mit der Arbeit beginnst!
#. fr: Soyez <if $gn4>la bienvenue<else>le bienvenu</if>, <if $gn4>amie aventurière<else>ami aventurier</if>. Nos équipements d'artisanat sont ouverts à tous. Pourriez-vous me montrer vos matériaux, s'il vous plaît<nbsp>?
#. speaker: NELLEMOND
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_NELLEMOND_000_090:1"
msgid "Greetings, friend! Our doors─assuming we had any─are open to all! You wish to process those materials, yes? Hmmm... If you would first permit me to conduct an inspection...?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふむ……材料袋のほう、たしかに預かりました。<br>多めに入っていますので、製作に必要なだけお渡ししますね。<br>準備はできておりますので、作業台はご自由にお使いください。
#. de: Ja, sehr gut. Das ist mehr als nötig. Hier, nimm so viel du brauchst! Die Arbeitsstätte steht dir zur freien Verfügung.
#. fr: Très bien, tout est en ordre. Vous pouvez maintenant vous mettre au travail si vous le souhaitez.
#. speaker: NELLEMOND
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_NELLEMOND_000_091:1"
msgid "Ah, my concern was for naught. These materials are both quality and plentiful! In fact, I have calculated the optimum amount required to craft the components you have in mind. I shall hold on to the excess while you work your synthesizing magic! Pray let me know if you require any replacements."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 材料が足りなかったり、<br>またこの製作施設を使いたくなったら声をかけてくださいね。
#. de: Falls das Material nicht reicht oder du mit der Arbeitsstätte nicht zurechtkommst, dann sag mir bitte Bescheid. Wir finden schon eine Lösung.
#. fr: Si jamais vous manquez de matériaux ou avez besoin de faire à nouveau usage de nos équipements, prévenez-moi et je ferai le nécessaire.
#. speaker: NELLEMOND
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_NELLEMOND_000_100:1"
msgid "The use of the crafting facility here at Treespeak Stables is entirely free of charge! Pray put concerns of sordid coin from your mind and concentrate on your wondrous creation!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 仕事はお済みのようですから、納品に行くとよいでしょう。<br>製作した品を紛失するなどして、<br>再度この施設を使用したいときは、私にお申し出ください。
#. de: Bist du schon fertig? Dann kannst du ja deine Waren abliefern! Falls du sie verlieren solltest und neu anfertigen musst, kannst du dich gerne wieder bei mir melden.
#. fr: Vous avez fini, si je ne m'abuse. Dans ce cas, il ne vous reste plus qu'à aller livrer votre commanditaire. En cas de perte, mettez-moi au courant et je verrai ce que je peux faire. Bonne route<nbsp>!
#. speaker: NELLEMOND
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_NELLEMOND_100_100:1"
msgid "Your crafting endeavor was a success? Then you must waste no time in returning to your client. Ah, and should something unfortunate befall your commission─accidental loss, theft, act of primal─you always have the option of retrieving from me the remaining materials and trying again!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item "　8093" 0>」はまだかッァ？<br>完成したら、ワシに見せてくれッェ！
#. de: Khaaa, hast du <noun-de Item 5 "　8093" 2 4 1>? Zeig mal!
#. fr: Alors, où sont <noun-fr Item 6 "　8093" 2 1><nbsp>? Le Dezul Qualan ne va pas se construire tout seul<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_130:1"
msgid "Squaaawk! Suffer the barbs of his comrades, the Able cannot! Bring me the starboard hull components, you must!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……これは、見事な出来ばえッェ！　恩に着るわッァ！<br>親方と<if $gn4>ネエチャン<else>アンチャン</if>に、どこまでもついていくわッァ！
#. de: Khaaa, khaaa! Jaaa! Großartig bist du! Fast so wie Große Schwinge.
#. fr: Oooh... Que <if $gn4>celle-là<else>celui-là</if> me pardonne. C'est du travail de pro<shy>fes<shy>sion<shy>nel, foi de celui-ci<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
#. macro: <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_131:1"
msgid "Squa-hawk! Safe, my reputation is! To featherless <if $gn4>craftswoman<else>craftsman</if>, much and more is owed!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: それにしても伐採所の連中めッェ……<br>卑怯な嫌がらせをしやがってッェ！<br>あんな連中に、親方の夢を邪魔させてなるもんかッァー！
#. de: Ixal aus Kahlhieb jetzt blöd aus den Federn gucken! Nicht so schnell wieder auf uns herumhacken! Danke, danke!
#. fr: Quant à ces satanés faux frères du site de déboisement... Quand arrêteront-ils de mettre des bâtons dans les roues de ceux-ci<nbsp>!? Celui-ci ne les laissera pas briser le rêve des Planeurs d'Ehcatl<nbsp>!
#. speaker: YAZELAHUATAN
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_YAZELAHUATAN_000_132:1"
msgid "Rejoin the ranks of the buzzards, I wish not to do. Much more beloved by maidens, Yazel is, as able revolutionary!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 製作の準備が整った。
#. de: Die Arbeitsstätte steht dir jetzt zur Verfügung.
#. fr: Vous pouvez maintenant utiliser les installations d'artisanat.
#. speaker: POPMESSAGE
msgctxt "quest/014/BanIxa103_01496:TEXT_BANIXA103_01496_POPMESSAGE_000_200:1"
msgid "You now have access to the crafting facility."
msgstr ""
